      "type": "text",
      "text": "NoiseFit app requires background location permission while using Bluetooth to search or to connect with Bluetooth devices. When the NoiseFit application is running in the background, it also needs location information to display the motion trajectory and distance to the user through the location information.\n",
      "image": null,
      "bold": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Follow the steps below:\n\nSettings > Apps > NoiseFit > Permissions > Location > Choose ‘Allow all the time’\n",
      "image": null,
      "bold": true
    },
